* Run like "pg python" or "pg python pydantic"
    * "pg python" opens an anonymous session stored under "~/.pg/sessions/anonymous/python-$timestamp"
    * "pg python pydantic" opens a named session called "pydantic" stored at "~/.pg/sessions/named/pydantic"
* Python file opened in editor populated with template for python script
    * Editor is taken from $EDITOR
    * ~/.pg/templates/python is searched for template
    * Fallback to using built-in template
* Current tmux pane split horizontally in two
    * Top pane is for editor
    * Bottom pane is for results
* When editor is saved, code is executed and output is displayed in results pane
* When editor is closed, results pane is closed
